3. YOUR DATA IS YOURS

Khazana stores your financial data on your device, encrypted with a key derived
from your PIN. We do not receive it, cannot read it, and do not want it.

You may export your complete data at any time, in an encrypted backup and in
plain CSV.

We cannot recover your PIN. There is no reset, no recovery code, and no back
door. This is a deliberate design decision — a recovery path we controlled
would mean we could read your vault. If you forget your PIN and have no backup,
the data is permanently unreadable, by you and by us alike.

Keep your own backups. Read section 5 before deciding not to.


4. NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE

Khazana is a record-keeping and calculation tool. Its scores, projections,
tax estimates, insurance coverage suggestions and written insights are
informational only. They are not investment, tax, insurance, accounting or
legal advice, and are not a recommendation to buy or sell anything.

We are not a registered investment adviser, broker, insurance intermediary or
tax practitioner in any jurisdiction. Tax rules, market data and exchange rates
change; figures may be out of date or wrong. Verify anything that matters with
a qualified professional before acting on it.

Market prices, NAVs and exchange rates, where shown, come from third-party
providers and are supplied as-is. Demo market data, when you switch it on, is
generated on your device, is clearly labelled, and represents nothing real.


